          <li><a href="#comparison-table" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Comparison vs Typical Mountain Resorts</a></li>
          <li><a href="#accommodation" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Accommodation — All Room Types</a></li>
          <li><a href="#amenities" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Amenities Built Around the View</a></li>
          <li><a href="#things-to-do" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Things to Do From the Resort</a></li>
