        </ol>
      </nav>

      <!-- TOP SHARE BAR -->
      <BlogShareBar
        title={pageTitle}
        url={canonicalUrl}
        description={pageDescription}
        label="Planning a trip? Share this guide with your travel group"
        className="mb-12"
      />

      <!-- INTRO -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[#2C3531] space-y-5 mb-14">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
          There is a specific moment every guest at Whispering Pines Resort describes in their review.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
          They step out of the car after six hours on the road from Delhi, turn to face the ridge — and stop. Because there, filling the entire sky above the pine canopy, is the Nanda Devi and Trishul Himalayan range. 180°. Unobstructed. Silent. Impossibly large. Not behind a fence or viewed through a tourist crowd — but right there from the private grounds of the property where they will wake up the next morning.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
          That moment is the reason <a href="/about-whispering-pines-resort-ramgarh/" class="font-semibold text-[#1B3322] hover:text-[#c9a832] underline underline-offset-2">Casa De Bello Whispering Pines Resort</a> in Malla Ramgarh is considered the finest <strong>Himalayan view resort in Uttarakhand</strong> for guests who travel specifically for the mountain panorama — not just a mountain backdrop.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
          The city you came from — the traffic, the noise, the grey sky — does not just feel far away. It stops existing entirely.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
          Rated 4.6★ from 388 verified Google reviews. Located on the Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar Road in Malla Ramgarh, Nainital district, at 1,780 metres altitude. A 4-star boutique mountain resort with 25 premium rooms, a standalone <a href="/private-villas-near-nainital/" class="font-semibold text-[#1B3322] hover:text-[#c9a832] underline underline-offset-2">private villa sleeping up to 10</a>, an on-site swimming pool, 150 Mbps enterprise fiber optic Wi-Fi, and 180° panoramic views of the Nanda Devi and Trishul Himalayan peaks from every single room, balcony, terrace, and outdoor lawn.
        </p>

        <!-- Quick Stats -->
        <div id="aeo-quick-facts" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 my-8 not-prose">
          <div class="bg-[#1B3322] text-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-[#c9a832]/20">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#c9a832]">4.6★</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1 uppercase tracking-wide">Google Rating</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">388 reviews</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1B3322] text-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-[#c9a832]/20">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#c9a832]">1,780m</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1 uppercase tracking-wide">Altitude</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Malla Ramgarh ridge</div>
          </div>
