          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1B3322] text-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-[#c9a832]/20">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#c9a832]">25+</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1 uppercase tracking-wide">Premium Rooms</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">+ Private Villa</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WHY VIEW IS DIFFERENT -->
      <section id="why-view-is-different" class="mb-14 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B3322] mb-6 border-b border-[#c9a832]/30 pb-3">Why the Himalayan View Here Is Different from Every Other Property on the Mukteshwar Road</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-5 font-light">Not every property that calls itself a <strong>Himalayan view resort in Uttarakhand</strong> delivers a genuine Himalayan view. The distinction matters enormously when the view is the primary reason for the trip. The view at Whispering Pines differs in three specific, verifiable ways.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#EAE8E3] shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🏔️</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B3322] text-base mb-2">Ridge Position — 1,780m Unobstructed</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-light">The property sits on the Malla Ramgarh ridge at 1,780 metres — one of the highest ridgeline positions along the entire Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar corridor. No buildings, roads, or secondary ridges stand between the property terraces and the Himalayan range. The sightline is completely clean from orchard grass to Nanda Devi at 7,816 metres.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#EAE8E3] shadow-sm">
